    "detailed_description": "Embark on an adrenaline-fueled journey in Dead Red Bennie, where precision is key. Score points by swiftly taking down waves of enemies, aiming for the highest score in the shortest time. Maintain your combo to maximize points, creating an intense and strategic gaming experience that challenges both your reflexes and accuracy.<br><br><strong>Leaderboards Hunters Only</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767510/extras/3b9ff27d96ca563fdb63b51d08e322fd.poster.avif?t=1752215116\" width=608 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767510/extras/3b9ff27d96ca563fdb63b51d08e322fd.webm?t=1752215116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767510/extras/3b9ff27d96ca563fdb63b51d08e322fd.mp4?t=1752215116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Replay the same levels over-and-over to beat your friend on the leaderboards and take the bragging rights home!<br><br><i>You will LOVE this IF</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>'COMMANDO' was your one of your favorite games in the 80's<br></li><li>'THE CLUB' was an under-rated gem of a game !<br></li><li>'GEOMETRY WARS' simple controls and excellent leaderboard terror hunted you for months<br></li><li>Leaderboard hunting like oldskool pinball machines is your poison</li></ul><br><strong>THIS GAME ONLY WORKS WITH A CONTROLLER !</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>Left Stick to <strong>MOVE</strong>, Right Stick to <strong>FIRE</strong> and RB to <strong>THROW</strong> a grenade</i></li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767510/extras/e0bcb62928808a5a55d7933de7275ac4.poster.avif?t=1752215116\" width=608 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767510/extras/e0bcb62928808a5a55d7933de7275ac4.webm?t=1752215116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767510/extras/e0bcb62928808a5a55d7933de7275ac4.mp4?t=1752215116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
